    given-names: "Steffen"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-20
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/profdrheld-eng/nhanes-activity-contrast"
url: "https://github.com/profdrheld-eng/nhanes-activity-contrast/releases/tag/v1.0.0"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible analysis code for the NHANES 2003–2006 hip and 2011–2014
  wrist measurement-period comparisons of self-reported and device-measured
  physical activity, mortality associations, and exploratory age relationships.
  Participant-level data and fitted model objects are not distributed.
keywords:
  - NHANES
  - physical activity
  - accelerometry
  - reproducibility
